<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post1739193539855858199..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: California&#39;s Gun-Grabbing Einsatzgruppen </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>12</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3502035560802290886</id><published>2013-11-25T08:28:07.627-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-25T08:28:07.627-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I would not live in nor even visit Kalifornia. But...</title><content type='html'>I would not live in nor even visit Kalifornia. But if I did, there is no doubt that some drunken pedophile in their government would declare me as &amp;quot;unsuitable to have a firearm. That arbitrary decision, and the subsequent raid on my person, would result in the deaths of several costumed, badged, armed thugs masquerading as &amp;quot;peace officers. I too would probably die in the ensuing battle, but I would go down knowing that I defended myself against them.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/3502035560802290886'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/3502035560802290886'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385393287627#c3502035560802290886' title=''/><author><name>peck2</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-509661380"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 25, 2013 at 8:28 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4508254234985398285</id><published>2013-11-24T04:45:11.751-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-24T04:45:11.751-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I have placed a link as you suggested on the Polic...</title><content type='html'>I have placed a link as you suggested on the Police State page of my musings - Thank you for the information.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/4508254234985398285'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/4508254234985398285'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385293511751#c4508254234985398285' title=''/><author><name>nomomrniceguy</name><uri>http://nomomrniceguy.wordpress.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/openid16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1375293869"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 24, 2013 at 4:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1555540312100675336</id><published>2013-11-23T15:54:52.703-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-23T15:54:52.703-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I feel like sending every one of these stories to ...</title><content type='html'>I feel like sending every one of these stories to my local police chief and sheriff under the subject line: &amp;quot;Activities that will get your officers killed&amp;quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/1555540312100675336'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/1555540312100675336'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385247292703#c1555540312100675336' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-631578002"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 23, 2013 at 3:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8137051842787569818</id><published>2013-11-22T22:22:36.473-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-22T22:22:36.473-07:00</updated><title type='text'>What few people appreciate is that EVERYTHING the ...</title><content type='html'>What few people appreciate is that EVERYTHING the Nazis did in Germany was lawful. Anything they wanted to do to anyone, they just passed a &amp;quot;law&amp;quot; to authorize it. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Same thing is happening here and now. These knuckle-dragging baboons that call themselves &amp;quot;police&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;judges&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;district attorneys&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;government in general&amp;quot; cover their filthy appetites with a snow-white cloak of &amp;quot;lawfulness.&amp;quot; But any child of five can tell you their &amp;quot;laws&amp;quot; are full of shit. Their &amp;quot;laws&amp;quot; are just the greed, the corruption and the viciousness of a whole class of bloodsucking parasites feeding on the goodwill of the normal, sane human race. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Time comes soon for We The People to squash them like bugs. Send them back under the rocks they crawled out from. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We should not shoot them. Let them take our guns away. A sharp knife is much more satisfying. You can watch the fear in their eyes before you remove bits and pieces of their bodies from the rest of them, sending them finally to the Land Of Terror where their Lord Satan will greet them and keep them warm in his embrace for all eternity.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/8137051842787569818'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/8137051842787569818'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385184156473#c8137051842787569818' title=''/><author><name>The Hour Cometh</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1438931946"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 22, 2013 at 10:22 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8045554568045831011</id><published>2013-11-22T15:29:13.000-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-22T15:29:13.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Why not launch a new initiative to disarm the poli...</title><content type='html'>Why not launch a new initiative to disarm the police in California?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/8045554568045831011'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/8045554568045831011'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385159353000#c8045554568045831011' title=''/><author><name>A Voice of Sanity</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11285284153694191831</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_ovhvhJ6xtPM/Sto0Q1l13HI/AAAAAAAAAmE/AyPfkbU1wRA/S220/shark.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-861964396"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 22, 2013 at 3:29 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1374299518928310347</id><published>2013-11-22T13:55:30.441-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-22T13:55:30.441-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Emeryville Police Chief Ken James is a moron who w...</title><content type='html'>Emeryville Police Chief Ken James is a moron who would run out on a rail in most of the country. Disgusting individual, a true Nazi in the making.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/1374299518928310347'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/1374299518928310347'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385153730441#c1374299518928310347' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1952002594"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 22, 2013 at 1:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2726149888974395915</id><published>2013-11-22T13:53:05.904-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-22T13:53:05.904-07:00</updated><title type='text'>recall what happened to the &amp;#39;prohibited person...</title><content type='html'>recall what happened to the &amp;#39;prohibited persons&amp;#39; - jews, catholics, gypsies and mentally challenged - in germany, circa the &amp;#39;30&amp;#39;s and &amp;#39;40&amp;#39;s. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/2726149888974395915'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/2726149888974395915'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385153585904#c2726149888974395915' title=''/><author><name>kitrk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-459582723"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 22, 2013 at 1:53 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1792779119464609490</id><published>2013-11-22T09:30:14.389-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-22T09:30:14.389-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Personally I hope that dozens of these storm troop...</title><content type='html'>Personally I hope that dozens of these storm troopers  die for their crimes, or perhaps even the ring leader Kamala Harris.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If this happens I also hope that the victims get somone like me on their jury to aquit them.  Some justice for a change.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/1792779119464609490'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/1792779119464609490'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385137814389#c1792779119464609490' title=''/><author><name>InalienbleWrights</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-526139553"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 22, 2013 at 9:30 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7189767160289154514</id><published>2013-11-22T04:22:47.819-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-22T04:22:47.819-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Excuse me??? &amp;quot;Prohibited Persons&amp;quot;? Where...</title><content type='html'>Excuse me??? &amp;quot;Prohibited Persons&amp;quot;? Where have we heard this sort of rank bullshit before? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;From Wikipedia:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;In the George Orwell book 1984, an Unperson is someone who has been vaporized. Vaporization is when a person is murdered by being turned into vapors. Not only has an Unperson been killed; they have also been erased from society, the universe, and existence. Such a person would be taken out of books, photographs, and articles so that no trace of them is found in the present anywhere – no record of them would be found.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Josef Stalin used to turn his enemies into Unpersons in exactly such ways. It has happened before. Is THAT what these bloodsucking leeches in California want to achieve by making people &amp;quot;Prohibited Persons&amp;quot;? Like the juntas in Chile, who would &amp;quot;disappear&amp;quot; someone and then claim no such person ever existed?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Now we know what playbook these stinking vermin read from and which god they worship. Their god is the god of Raw Power and Black Screaming Death. Evil is too mild a word for these creatures. Vile, filthy, vicious, and foul, this is what they are.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mr. Grigg, you are right to be alarmed. This is just the tip of an iceberg, hard, cold, and deadly. It will only get worse. And worse. And worse. Until We the People destroy these cockroaches by stepping on them with a large and annihilating boot.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/7189767160289154514'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/7189767160289154514'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385119367819#c7189767160289154514' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1438931946"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 22, 2013 at 4:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4706944062642410961</id><published>2013-11-22T03:38:36.637-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-22T03:38:36.637-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Kamala Harris: &amp;quot;They are those people who hav...</title><content type='html'>Kamala Harris: &amp;quot;They are those people who have been proven to violate the law, and present a threat to public safety.” Harris insists that proactive disarmament of “dangerous, violent individuals ... is smart and efficient law enforcement.”   Oh yay, they&amp;#39;re FINALLY going to disarm the murderous cops who have proven they don&amp;#39;t have a CLUE what the law is?  No?  That&amp;#39;s not what she means?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;All humor aside, these criminal thug cops deserve a face full of much more than angry words.  Where is Solzhenitsyn’s wisdom when we need it?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/4706944062642410961'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/4706944062642410961'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385116716637#c4706944062642410961' title=''/><author><name>JdL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1845540825"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 22, 2013 at 3:38 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2892234274096951651</id><published>2013-11-21T12:24:43.519-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-21T12:24:43.519-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I appreciate the critique -- and I&amp;#39;ve acted on...</title><content type='html'>I appreciate the critique -- and I&amp;#39;ve acted on it. :-)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/2892234274096951651'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/2892234274096951651'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385061883519#c2892234274096951651' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='22' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-Ol6GVktahVU/UhwPgHyhnNI/AAAAAAAAJeQ/ik4eBjgEKPs/s220/New%2BHeadshot.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 21, 2013 at 12:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9080169333471056333</id><published>2013-11-21T12:21:40.860-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-21T12:21:40.860-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Although the gist of the article is excellent as u...</title><content type='html'>Although the gist of the article is excellent as usual, the use of the term &amp;quot;high-caliber weaponry&amp;quot; is technically inapt. There is no such thing as a high caliber weapon. There are high powered weapons and there are large caliber weapons, but the awkward synthesis of these phrases is technically incorrect and misleading. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This term is widely used now by news media know nothings to demonize any weapon that shows up in a news story. That should be enough evidence of it&amp;#39;s bogus nature to satisfy anyone. I expect that soon this bastardized term will be used to describe squirt guns and toaster pastry nibbled into the profile of a firearm.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Sorry about the rant Will, but the widespread use of this term by gun grabbers really bugs me.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/9080169333471056333'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1739193539855858199/comments/default/9080169333471056333'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html?showComment=1385061700860#c9080169333471056333' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/californias-gun-grabbing-einsatzgruppen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1739193539855858199' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1739193539855858199' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-57840219"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 21, 2013 at 12:21 PM"/></entry></feed>